{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nevkmps","type":"work","title":"針灸聚英","authors":[{"name":"高武","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9beu8"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《針灸聚英》•四卷","author_info":"明高武撰","summary":"明高武撰。武始末未詳。是書以經絡空穴類聚為一卷，各病取穴治法為一卷，諸論針灸法為一卷，各歌賦為一卷。凡諸書與《素問》、《難經》異同者，取其同而論其異，故以聚英名書。其所蒐采，惟《銅人明堂子午》及《竇氏流注》等書，餘皆不錄。","edition":"兩淮鹽政采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《鍼灸聚英》四卷","author_info":"明高武撰","summary":"《鍼灸聚英》四卷。明高武撰。影印明嘉靖刻本。","edition":"影印明嘉靖刻本","volume":"第996冊","section":"子部 醫家類"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《鍼灸聚英》四卷","author_info":"明高武撰","summary":"《鍼灸聚英》四卷。明高武撰。中國中醫研究院圖書館藏明嘉靖十六年陶師文刻本。","edition":"中國中醫研究院圖書館藏明嘉靖十六年陶師文刻本","volume":"第48冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":4},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingkeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02093081","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖刻本","version":"v5","total_page":579,"paragraph_count":1971,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02055060","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v2","total_page":572,"paragraph_count":6333,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0996%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":996},"types":["image"]}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":4}],"measure_info":"四卷","updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":true,"_has_image":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈借力志書〉之法——本